    "definitions": {
      "contamination_flagged": "A decided sequence is contamination-flagged when it is in this report's contamination_warnings (results[].contamination_flagged, or contamination_score >= 0.5) or its decision.result_class is possible_contamination. sequences_contamination_flagged counts them; the taxa they named are listed in contamination_flagged_taxa, not in richness or top taxa. sequences_with_taxon + sequences_without_taxon + sequences_contamination_flagged = sequences_with_decision.",
      "fraction_with_taxon": "sequences_with_taxon / (sequences_with_decision - sequences_contamination_flagged); null when every decided sequence is contamination-flagged. Low-quality sequences are in the denominator (they never get a taxon) and listed under without_taxon_reasons.",
      "reference_dbs": "Distinct (decision.reference_db, decision.reference_db_version) pairs, counted per sequence; a decision names the reference DB whenever the lookup ran, assigned or not. This is DB usage, so contamination-flagged sequences are included.",
      "richness_by_rank": "For each taxon_rank, the number of distinct predicted_taxon names decided at that rank, over sequences that are not contamination-flagged (contaminants are not counted as observed taxa). Ranks are never mixed or summed into one richness: a genus-level call and a species of that genus are counted separately, each at its own rank. A taxon without a rank is 'unranked'. Listed finest rank first (species, genus, family, order, class, phylum, kingdom, superkingdom), other ranks after by name, 'unranked' last.",
      "taxon": "Per sequence: results[].decision.predicted_taxon at results[].decision.taxon_rank, the orchestrator's combined answer (after the plant genus cap). Sequences without a decision (written before the orchestrator) are not counted; a decision with a null taxon counts as without taxon. Contamination-flagged sequences (see contamination_flagged) are not observed taxa and are excluded from sequences_with/without_taxon, richness_by_rank and top_taxa.",
      "top_taxa": "(taxon, rank) groups of not contamination-flagged sequences by sequence count, ties by name, first 20; fraction_of_assigned = sequences / sequences_with_taxon. mean/min/max_percent_identity are over the group's sequences whose decision carries a percent_identity (arithmetic mean, 2 dp); taxon_groups counts every group before the cut (a row count, not a richness estimate).",
      "without_taxon_reasons": "For each decided, not contamination-flagged sequence with no taxon: 'low_quality' when decision.final_route is low_quality, otherwise the rule of the taxon step in decision_trace.combine (':' + its outcome when that is a status string, e.g. no_reference_assignment:below_threshold), or 'not_recorded' when the trace has no taxon step."
    },
